This approach is easily customizable and editable for future updates, as it separates the HTML, CSS, and JavaScript code, and uses CSS classes to apply styles and behavior. You can modify the HTML structure and CSS styles to fit your website design, and adapt the JavaScript code to different events and behaviors as needed.

